<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>In<sp/>main.cpp:<sp/>the<sp/>runner,<sp/>with<sp/>external<sp/>linkage.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
